part lazur_2025
  tally 1
  note "Bank Lazur floren account LN88 1020 0044 8813 FLR, 2025: the whole export (18 rows). Kessel's payments explain kessel_pay; each floren sale is Piotr's own order, which no pay explains (booked to outside_FLR), carrying the invoice it sells; its dukats come from the market's buy rate (B-D23 §4)."
  note "Each version covers from its row day to the day before the next row day (the last to 2025-12-31), known on its row day: the account is seen live, so each row is known on its own day (story). The account opened on 2025-01-02 (B-D23)."

version laz_open
  cite lazur_export
  governs 2025-01-02..2025-03-02
  known 2025-01-02
  covers lazur
  note "no row before the first payment"

